      "text": "在 Scrublet 0.2.3 中，mean_center=true 时文档说明将使用 sklearn.decomposition.PCA 进行降维。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 3,
          "quote": "mean_center : bool, optional (default: True)\n            If True, center the data such that each gene has a mean of 0.\n            `sklearn.decomposition.PCA` will be used for dimensionality\n            reduction."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "normalize_variance=true 时文档说明将使用 TruncatedSVD，但明确限定“除非 mean_center 为 True”。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 2,
          "quote": "normalize_variance : bool, optional (default: True)\n            If True, normalize the data such that each gene has a variance of 1.\n            `sklearn.decomposition.TruncatedSVD` will be used for dimensionality\n            reduction, unless `mean_center` is True."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "由于你提供的 mean_center=true 满足该例外条件，因此按文档语义应走 PCA 路径，而不是 TruncatedSVD。",
